; `eval EXPR` inside a regular transaction is an expression line, as it
; is inside an automated transaction and as its synonym `expr` is in
; both: it is evaluated, not read as a posting to an account named
; "eval ...".  An account whose name only begins with "eval" is still a
; posting.

= /Food/
    eval auto_total = 3
    assert auto_total == 3

2024/01/01 Payee
    eval inline_total = 7
    assert inline_total == 7
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    evaluation:Fees    $1.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal
             $-11.00  Assets:Cash
              $10.00  Expenses:Food
               $1.00  evaluation:Fees
--------------------
                   0
end test
